# Cloudflare _headers — security + cache policy (fleex-optim pattern).
#
# ⚠️ Cloudflare Workers Static Assets applies ALL matching rules to a response
# and CONCATENATES same-named headers — they are ADDITIVE, not
# most-specific-wins (verified live: /version.json returned "no-store, no-store"
# from two matching blocks). Therefore `/*` must carry ONLY headers wanted on
# EVERY response — the security set — and NEVER a Cache-Control, or it would
# poison the immutable assets with a conflicting directive (no-store + immutable
# → no-store wins → assets stop being cached). Cache-Control is set per path.
#
# Security headers live once in /* and apply everywhere by concatenation, so the
# per-path Cache-Control blocks below don't restate them.
#
# connect-src allowlist: BeNomad hosts (*.benomad.com / *.benomad.net) for the
# map/auth/tiles + the Cloud Run solver (*.run.app). Keep in sync with the
# solver-host allowlist in src/app/config.js.
#
# Cache policy (EVMOVE-457):
# - HTML shell ("/" and /index.html) + version.json → no-store, so a returning
#   browser always sees a new build (the version guard's stale-shell recovery).
# - /assets/* (Vite content-hashed) + /jquery/* (stamped ?v=, flat) → immutable.
# - /bemap-js-api/* → no-cache, must-revalidate: the top-level SDK files are
#   ?v=-stamped, but the SDK's own CSS references NESTED, UNSTAMPED resources
#   (images/marker-icon.png, spritesheet.*, glyph fonts) — immutable would leave
#   those stale for a year after an SDK re-vendor; no-cache lets them revalidate.

/*
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' https://*.benomad.com https://*.benomad.net https://*.run.app http://localhost:8080 http://127.0.0.1:8080 https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

/
  Cache-Control: no-store

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-store

/version.json
  Cache-Control: no-store

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/jquery/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/bemap-js-api/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
